<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Scan</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Ranger (guild level 0), Druid (guild level 4, up to 50%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>scan                  every way out, one room away
scan &lt;number&gt;         every way out, that many rooms away
scan &lt;direction&gt;      one way, as far as you can
scan &lt;number&gt; &lt;direction&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>scan
scan north
scan 2 east
</pre>
<p>Looks out of the room to see who and what is in the rooms around you. 
Anyone can scan one room away. With the skill you see further: two rooms 
from 40%, and three, the most anyone can, at 100%. Name a direction alone, 
and you look that way as far as your skill lets you.
</p><p>You can't see through closed doors, and those who are hidden or invisible 
stay unseen, though with sense life you feel that a hidden life form is 
there. You must be standing; you can also scan from a boat.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
